  "description": "Single Speed Retro Style Lowrider Bike\n\nFeaturing an iconic frame and springer fork.\nVintage details include high-rise ape handlebars, banana seat, and sissy bar for that boss '70's look.\nSingle speed drivetrain is easy to use and maintain. Rear coaster brake provides intuitive stopping.\n20” wheel features real fat tire. Lightweight aluminum rims. Fenders look great and help protect you from splashes.\nFits riders aged 6 and up.\n\nFRAME\nTracer 20\" Steel Lowrider Classic Deluxe Edition Steel\n\nFORK\nTracer 20\" Classic Increase the bending Spring\n\nFRONT HUB\nSteel Chrome 140 SPOKE 14G.\n\nFENDERS\nPainted steel fenders with retro brackets and steel braces\n\nWEIGHT\nThe most accurate way to determine any bike’s weight is to have your local dealer weigh it for you. Many brands strive to list the lowest possible weight, but in reality, weight can vary based on size, finish, hardware and accessories. All our bikes are designed for best-in-class weight and ride quality.",
